      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "Factor: (2x - 1)(x + 1) = 0. So 2x - 1 = 0 (x = 1/2) or x + 1 = 0 (x = -1).",
      "steps": [
        "1. Use AC method: a = 2, c = -1, ac = -2.",
        "2. Factors of -2 summing to 1: 2 and -1.",
        "3. Rewrite: 2x² + 2x - x - 1 = 0.",
        "4. Factor: 2x(x + 1) - 1(x + 1) = (2x - 1)(x + 1) = 0.",
        "5. Solutions: x = 1/2 or x = -1."
